@startuml RecallAI-DeploymentView
!pragma layout smetana
' SAD Section 5 — Deployment View. Issue #111 / PA4 mục a.
' No Docker/IaC config exists in this repo; topology below is the target
' deployment inferred from src/server/.env.example, src/client/.env.example
' and package.json (Express 5, @prisma/client + pg, @google/genai, React 19/Vite).
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodeStyle rectangle
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFF
  BorderColor #6A6AC0
}
title Recall AI — Deployment View

node "Client Device\n(desktop / mobile browser)" as ClientNode #F5F5FF {
  [React SPA\n(Vite + TypeScript)] as SPA
  note bottom of SPA
    Presentation Tier component (§4.2).
    VITE_API_BASE_URL points at the
    App/Web Server's HTTP(S) origin.
  end note
}

node "App/Web Server\n(Node.js + Express)" as AppNode #F5FFF5 {
  [Express REST API\n(Routes -> Controllers -> Services)] as API
  [Scheduling & Remediation\nEngine (SRE)] as SRE
  [AI Examiner\n(state machine)] as AIExaminer
  [Prisma Client] as PrismaClient
  note bottom of AppNode
    Application Tier components (§4.2-4.7)
    all co-located on this node.
    PORT (default 3001), JWT_SECRET,
    JWT_REFRESH_SECRET configured here.
  end note
}

node "DB Server\n(PostgreSQL)" as DBNode #FFF8F0 {
  database "PostgreSQL\n(13 tables)" as DB
  note bottom of DB
    Data Tier (§4.6). Reached via
    DATABASE_URL (postgresql://...).
  end note
}

cloud "Google Gemini API\n(external, managed by Google)" as Gemini #FFF0F0 {
  note bottom of Gemini
    4 fixed-schema calls only:
    extract_concepts, generate_question,
    grade_answer, summarize_session (C4/C5).
    Reached via GEMINI_API_KEY.
  end note
}

ClientNode --> AppNode : HTTPS REST\n(JSON, JWT Bearer)
API --> PrismaClient : in-process
PrismaClient --> DBNode : SQL over TCP\n(Prisma, DATABASE_URL)
AppNode --> Gemini : HTTPS REST\n(fixed JSON schema, GEMINI_API_KEY)

legend right
  |= Node |= Runs |= Protocol in |
  | Client Device   | React SPA (static assets, served from App/Web Server or a CDN) | HTTPS to App/Web Server |
  | App/Web Server   | Express API, Controllers/Services, SRE, AI Examiner, Prisma Client | HTTPS in from Client; SQL out to DB; HTTPS out to Gemini |
  | DB Server        | PostgreSQL (13 tables, §4.6)                | SQL over TCP from App/Web Server |
  | Google Gemini API (external) | Managed Gemini models, called only with fixed JSON schemas | HTTPS in from App/Web Server |
endlegend

@enduml
